Manage credential sources

Usage:
  mcp-runtime credential source [command]

Available Commands:
  apply                Create or update metadata from a JSON file
  authorize-kubernetes Grant or revoke broker GET permission for one approved Secret
  delete               Delete metadata at its current revision
  get                  Get redacted metadata by name
  list                 List metadata visible in a namespace

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for source

Global Flags:
      --debug   Enable debug mode with structured error logging

Use "mcp-runtime credential source [command] --help" for more information about a command.
